  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Responsive, Accountable Governance and Peacebuilding Project 2.0</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &#x201c;Responsive, Accountable Governance and Peacebuilding (RAGP) Project Initiation Plan 2.0&#x201d; is designed to build on the gains from the implementation of its predecessor PIP 1.0 (Jan-Dec 2024) and capitalizes on the recent democratic consolida-tion in the country while addressing critical development gaps in The Gambia&#x2019;s governance, peacebuilding, and socio-eco-nomic transformation. It seeks to contribute towards achieving the UNSDCF (2024-2028) Outcome 2.1, which states: &#x201c;By 2028, marginalized and vulnerable people in The Gambia participate in functional, accountable, and transparent institutions for the efficient delivery of public services and good governance.&#x201d;</narrative>
  </description>
